      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Unbeaten Victorian VERBICI (1) stretched his perfect record to seven when he drew on the back row and raced parked before drawing clear to take out the G1 Vicbred Super Series Final by close to 9m at Melton last start. That was four weeks ago but he was kept up to the mark with a trial. Has won here before and the ace draw gives him every chance to continue on his winning way. CHIEF KENNY (2) resumes off a string of seconds at this circuit and distance, the last of them coming in the 2YO Trot NSW Final in July. Draws well and has been readied with three trials, winning the last two. KEAYANG MARCUS (6) has trialled since his fresh placing at Ballarat so should have come on and is lightly raced with upside. ORLANDO VEYRON (3) placed behind VERBICI in the Vicbred final last start. Draws well and won his lone try at this distance so include.",
